<title>USA: Timber Lodge plans 17th restaurant.</title>
<headline>Timber Lodge plans 17th restaurant.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timber Lodge Steakhouse Inc said Monday it will begin construction of a new Timber Lodge Steakhouse in Crystal, Minn., which is scheduled to open in mid-November.</p>
<p>The new steakhouse will be the company's eighth in the Minneapolis/St. Paul market and 17th overall.</p>
<p>A steakhouse in Vernon Hills, Ill., its 15th, is completed and scheduled to open on August 21. The 16th steakhouse is under construction in Arlington Heights, Ill., and scheduled to open in October.</p>
<p>Timber Lodge operates steakhouses in Minnesota, South Dakota, Wisconsin, western New York and northern Illinois.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
